  "body": "ASTERION REACH\nTHE STARS REMEMBER\n◈\n191+48\nCREDITS\n◇\n112+16\nMINERALS\n✧\n0+30\nSCIENCE\n⌘\n5 / 9\nORDERS\nРусский\nGalaxy\nResearch\nDiplomacy\nEmpire\nChronicle\nHome\n1\n2\n3\n4\n⌂Solace\nCONCORD\nVeyr Prime\nVEYR\nMeridian\nVOLCANIC\nHesper\nBARREN\nAurelia\nVOLCANIC\nVelorum\nGLACIAL\nCarina\nVEYR\nOrison\nGLACIAL\nCinder\nOCEAN\nSundrift\nGLACIAL\nOphion\nARID\nAster\nVEYR\nHaven\nTERRAN\nIona\nVOLCANIC\nHalcyon\nGLACIAL\nAntares\nCONCORD\nMorrow\nTERRAN\nEos\nVOLCANIC\nAsterion\nCONCORD\n△\n▴\n△\n▴\n⬡\nTHE ASTERION REACH\nTHE UNCHARTED EXPANSE\nCONCORD EXPLORATION AUTHORITY\nThe Asterion Reach\n\n30 charted systems · 25 surveyed · seed ASTERION\n\n+\n−\n⌖\nA CIVILIZATION TAKES SHAPE\n3 worlds share your future. Develop your economy, meet the frontier powers, and choose your path to victory.\nPER ASPERA, AD ASTRA\nCONCORD\nCHARTED\nUNKNOWN\n⌂ FOUNDING WORLD\nDORMANT LANE\nPathfinder 1 / Aurelia\n\nAurelia → Asterion · 4 charted jumps\n\n↶\nHold position\n⌁ 4\n⇥\n△\n▴\n▴\n⬡\nCOURSE PREVIEW\nAsterion · 4 jumps · 4 orders total\nPlot course · free\n●\nAurelia\n›\n1\nMeridian\n›\n2\nAster\n›\n3\nHesper\n›\n4\nAsterion\n\nPlanning spends no orders. Opposition unknown at 3 stops.\n\nTHE CONCORD\nAsterion\n\nOcean world · Frontier system\n\nAn unbroken sea, rich with unfamiliar life.\n\n72%\nHABITABILITY\n1/7\nPOPULATION\n5\nPRODUCTION\nCOLONY PRODUCTION\n5 / CYCLE\n✧\nResearch Enclave\n\n4 cycles to completion\n\n×\nINFRASTRUCTURE\n0 / 2 SLOTS\n\nA new world, waiting to take shape.\n\n2 open slots. More population opens slots, up to five.\n\n⌂\nUnchartered\n\nGive this world a lasting specialty.\n\nDevelop →\n\n+5 credits · +1 minerals · +6 science\n\nANCIENT STARLANES\n⌁ Velorum ↗\n\nDormant · Not traversable\n\nRestore a permanent shortcut shared by all empires.\n\nReview restoration →\nIN ORBIT\n1 FLEET\nVanguard 3\nFrigate · 34 / 34 hull\nHolding\n1 jump\nDEFENSIVE LEAD\n\nDefault formation order\n\nYour formations defend separately in the order listed above. A surviving attacker can still reach later defenders.\n\nSelect one of your military formations above to assign or clear its lead. Either change costs one order.\n\nORBITAL MAINTENANCE\n4 HULL / CYCLE\n\nAll your fleets here are fully repaired.\n\nShips at one colony share its repair capacity. Splitting or merging does not increase the total.\nCONNECTED SYSTEMS\nHesper ↗\nOrison ↗\nCycle 13\n2412 CE\nEND CYCLE →\nSPACE\n5 orders remaining · 3 colonies\nCampaign exported. Keep this file as your backup.\nASTERION REACH / EARLY ACCESS 0.23.0\n● AUTOSAVED\n×\nРусский\nCOLONIAL COMMISSION · ASTERION\nShape this world's future\n\n0 / 2 infrastructure slots · 5 production per cycle. Each commission costs one order. Payment is made now; the project completes over the following cycles.\n\nInfrastructure\nColony charter\nShips\nStarlanes\nSTARLANE RESTORATION\nAsterion ↔ Velorum\nCOMMISSION COST\n◈ 60 · ◇ 70 · 1 order\nCONSTRUCTION\n48 work · 10 cycles at current production\n\n3 → 1Jumps between endpoints\n\n2 fewer movement orders per crossing.\n\nRoutes from Asterion\n\nCharted jumps · Before → After restoration\n\nSolace\nCapital\n3 → 3\nUnchanged\nAntares\n4 → 2\n\nCurrent borders apply. Jumps are not travel time.\n\nThe shortcut is permanent and shared. Other empires can use it under normal border rules, including hostile fleets during war.\n\nRestore lane · 1 order\n\nConstruction already in progress\n\nConstruction and movement rules",
